{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# AI 流程：将网页改造为手机 APP\n将 AI 生成的网页应用打包成手机 APP 的三种方法","x":0,"y":0,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"prep","type":"text","text":"## 一、应用准备与适配","x":-500,"y":0,"width":300,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"prep-details","type":"text","text":"**1. 案例选择**\n- 3D 跑酷游戏 (Google AI Studio)\n\n**2. 手机端适配**\n- 问题: 无物理键盘\n- AI 改造: Prompt 生成虚拟按键\n\n**3. 部署与测试**\n- GitHub 保存代码\n- Netlify 自动部署","x":-900,"y":-70,"width":350,"height":330},
		{"id":"pwa","type":"text","text":"## 二、方案一：PWA 应用","x":500,"y":-300,"width":300,"height":60,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"android","type":"text","text":"## 三、方案二：Android APK","x":500,"y":0,"width":300,"height":75,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"android-details","type":"text","text":"**工具**: Capacitor + Android Studio\n\n**步骤**\n1. `npm install @capacitor/core @capacitor/cli`\n2. `npx cap init`\n3. `npm install @capacitor/android`\n4. `npx cap add android`\n5. `npx cap sync`\n6. `npx cap open android` -> 打包 APK","x":900,"y":-160,"width":350,"height":310},
		{"id":"ios","type":"text","text":"## 四、方案三：iOS IPA","x":500,"y":300,"width":300,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ios-details","type":"text","text":"**注意**: 需 Mac 电脑 + Xcode\n\n**步骤**\n1. 安装 CocoaPods\n2. `npm install @capacitor/ios`\n3. `npx cap add ios`\n4. `npx cap open ios`\n5. 模拟器运行或真机调试","x":900,"y":200,"width":350,"height":260},
		{"id":"security","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ 安全提示","x":0,"y":300,"width":400,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"security-details","type":"text","text":"**API Key 安全**\n- ❌ 不要直接存放在客户端代码中\n- ✅ 使用后端服务转发请求\n- ✅ Key 存储在后端环境变量","x":0,"y":400,"width":400,"height":180},
		{"id":"pwa-details","type":"text","text":"**特点**\n- 轻量级，无需商店审核\n- 支持离线，全屏体验\n\n**步骤**\n1. 安装 `vite-plugin-pwa`\n2. 准备图标 (public 目录)\n3. AI 配置 `manifest.webmanifest` & `sw.js`\n4. 部署验证","x":900,"y":-540,"width":350,"height":320}
	],
